      "t": "Мы часто шагаем в пропасть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это из-за самоуверенности?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Да, мы слишком много хотели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вот ваш расчёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Только двадцать тысяч?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Остальное будет в конце месяца.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Farewell line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ребята, нам придётся расстаться с вами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Guys, we will have to part ways with you.' Nagiyev gathers everyone to deliver the heavy news that they are all being let go.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Куда вы собрались так рано?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you off to so early?' Senya asks where his colleague is heading, seemingly unaware of the bad news.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Нас уволили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We got fired.' Fedya drops the bomb that they just lost their jobs.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Как уволили? Тебя тоже?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How fired? You too?' Senya is absolutely shocked, asking if his friend is included in the cut.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Да, мы все уходим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, we are all leaving.' Fedya confirms the grim reality that the entire team has been axed.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "А что сказал шеф?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what did the chef say?' Senya wants to know how their fearless leader reacted to this mess.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф ничего не сделал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chef did nothing.' Fedya bitterly reveals that the boss stood by and did absolutely zero to stop it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Мы часто шагаем в пропасть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We often walk into the abyss.' He gets philosophical, comparing their situation to falling into a deep dark hole.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это из-за самоуверенности?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this because of overconfidence?' Senya wonders aloud if their own arrogance led to this disaster.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Да, мы слишком много хотели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, we wanted too much.' Fedya agrees, admitting they probably pushed their luck way too far.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вот ваш расчёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your payout.' Nagiyev hands over the final envelopes, keeping it strictly business.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Только двадцать тысяч?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only twenty thousand?' Senya is completely disappointed by the tiny amount of cash inside.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Остальное будет в конце месяца.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The rest will be at the end of the month.' Nagiyev promises the rest of the money will arrive eventually. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
